<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Happy Birthday Zuzu 🌸🎀</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@300;600;800&family=Pacifico&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg1: #fff2f8;
      --bg2: #fff7ff;
      --pink: #ff6fa3;
      --soft: #ffdfe9;
      --accent: #ff9ec9;
      --text: #3b2b3b;
    }
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;padding:0;font-family:Nunito, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial; background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--bg1),var(--bg2));color:var(--text)}
    .page{min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:30px}
    .card{width:960px;max-width:96%;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.9), rgba(255,250,255,0.95));border-radius:28px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(120,50,90,0.12);padding:28px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
    .top-row{display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:center}
    .kawaii{
      width:210px;height:210px;border-radius:20px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fff0f8);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(255,130,180,0.12);border:6px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.6)
    }
    .kawaii svg{width:140px;height:140px}
    h1{font-family:Pacifico, 'Nunito';font-size:40px;margin:0;color:var(--pink)}
    h2{margin:4px 0 12px;font-weight:600;color:#6b3b52}
    p.lead{font-size:18px;margin:0 0 18px;color:#5b3a4a}
    .message{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.85), rgba(255,245,250,0.7));padding:18px;border-radius:14px;border:1px dashed rgba(255,140,180,0.25)}
    .message p{margin:8px 0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5}
    .message .sign{margin-top:12px;font-weight:700;color:#7b3b4b}
    .flowers{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .flower{font-size:22px}
    .confetti{position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none}
    .controls{margin-top:16px;display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .btn{background:var(--pink);color:white;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:12px;border:0;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(255,110,160,0.18)}
    .btn.ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--pink);border:2px solid rgba(255,110,160,0.15)}
    .small{font-size:14px;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:10px}
    footer{margin-top:18px;color:#6b4354;font-size:13px}
    .heart{position:absolute;opacity:0.95}
    .heart.h1{left:12%;top:8%;font-size:34px}
    .heart.h2{right:10%;top:6%;font-size:30px}
    .heart.h3{right:6%;bottom:10%;font-size:28px}
    @media (max-width:700px){.top-row{flex-direction:column;align-items:center}.kawaii{width:160px;height:160px}.kawaii svg{width:120px;height:120px}h1{font-size:32px}}
    .confetti span{position:absolute;animation:drop 3s linear infinite}
    @keyframes drop{0%{transform:translateY(-10vh) rotate(0) }100%{transform:translateY(110vh) rotate(360deg)}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="confetti" aria-hidden="true">
        <span style="left:6%;top:-10%;font-size:20px">🎉</span>
        <span style="left:18%;top:-20%;font-size:16px;animation-delay:.3s">🌸</span>
        <span style="left:30%;top:-15%;font-size:18px;animation-delay:.6s">🎀</span>
        <span style="left:44%;top:-25%;font-size:22px;animation-delay:.1s">💖</span>
        <span style="left:62%;top:-10%;font-size:18px;animation-delay:.5s">🌼</span>
        <span style="left:78%;top:-12%;font-size:20px;animation-delay:.2s">✨</span>
      </div>
      <div class="heart h1">💗</div>
      <div class="heart h2">🌷</div>
      <div class="heart h3">🌺</div>
      <div class="top-row">
        <div class="kawaii" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 200 200" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <g fill="none" fill-rule="evenodd">
              <ellipse cx="100" cy="110" rx="66" ry="54" fill="#fff" stroke="#ffdfea" stroke-width="3"/>
              <path d="M58 66 Q40 44 56 32 Q72 48 58 66" fill="#fff" stroke="#ffdfea" stroke-width="3"/>
              <path d="M142 66 Q160 44 144 32 Q128 48 142 66" fill="#fff" stroke="#ffdfea" stroke-width="3"/>
              <circle cx="78" cy="108" r="8" fill="#3b2b3b"/>
              <circle cx="122" cy="108" r="8" fill="#3b2b3b"/>
              <ellipse cx="100" cy="130" rx="12" ry="6" fill="#ff9ec9"/>
              <path d="M92 120 Q100 126 108 120" stroke="#3b2b3b" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              <g transform="translate(130,76)">
                <ellipse cx="0" cy="0" rx="16" ry="12" fill="#ff6fa3"/>
                <ellipse cx="36" cy="0" rx="16" ry="12" fill="#ff6fa3"/>
                <circle cx="18" cy="0" r="8" fill="#ff9ec9"/>
              </g>
            </g>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div style="flex:1">
          <h1>Happy Birthday my Pretty Girl (zuzu:33) 🎀</h1>
          <div class="message" id="messageBox">
            <p>I wish for you all the joy you give others, multiplied a thousand times, a lot of kisses, pats and warm hugs to you my sweetheart mimi :33</p>
            <p>Keep shining, keep smiling, and remember you are so loved by me and by everyone mwahhhhh &lt;333</p>
            <p class="sign">always, <strong>your mimi</strong> 💗</p>
            <div class="flowers" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="flower">🌸</div>
              <div class="flower">🌷</div>
              <div class="flower">💐</div>
              <div class="flower">🌺</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <footer>Filled with 💖 and a thousand tiny flowers just for you.</footer>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
